  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram shows two blocks of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> in contact on a frictionless surface. A force F is applied on the block of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> and causes the blocks to move with an acceleration <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the force that the block of mass M is exerting on the block of mass m?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M + m a\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{m}{\\textit{M + m}} a\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
